    "body": "Stopped at Step 7 (held branch pushed to `mkinney:issue/1914-richauto` at `9fb271c2d`, not opening PR yet while `upstream/main` is red on #2244):\n\n- Implemented `assets/posts/richauto.cps`, registered `\"RichAuto DSP A11\"` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs::BUILTINS`, added `crates/post/tests/script_richauto.rs` + `richauto_safety`, `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs`, 24 goldens, and `docs/decisions/1914-richauto.md`.\n- Passed all `camcraft-post` suites (71 quick-gate steps including `script_richauto` 39/39 and `recorded_streams` 12/12), `clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `camcraft-app --lib` (353 passed; 1 ignored), and all 18 post-related `camcraft-app` suites (`conformance`, `tormach_end_units`, `explain_option`, `smoothing`, `program_units`, `post_script_options`, `post_spindle_rule_all`, `after_op`, `between_setups`, `recorded_post_streams`, `solid_law_goldens`, `carvera_post`, `tinyg_post`, `grblhal_post`, `tormach_post`, `lathe_post`, `plasma_post_refusals`, `wire_post`) + clippy on those targets.\n- Failed twice on Step 7 full `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (`app build (--no-run)`) and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` strictly at `crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs:106-107` (`error[E0308]` / `error[E0063]` on `CuttingRow`), which is pre-existing `upstream/main` #2244 (still unmerged at `e808c9629`).\n- Releasing `claimed`; once #2244 lands on `upstream/main`, `mkinney:issue/1914-richauto` can merge `upstream/main` and re-run the quick gate cleanly.\n",
